WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.250
In Shed setup, open Roof purlins / wall girts.

00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:07.750
Set TH64100 in the end bays and choose
Top Hat only for the internal bays.

00:00:07.750 --> 00:00:10.750
Calculate the 10 × 18 m shed.

00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:16.750
Switch to Physical model and drag to orbit the frame.

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:21.250
Select roof purlin SH-027. Its member checks
exceed the limits for this example.

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:24.250
Open View end fixings and select SH-027/start.

00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:28.250
The outward wind check uses 3.33 kN of the 5.32 kN
fixing resistance for this member end.

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:32.250
The detail shows one screw through each foot.
